{"author":"cursor[bot]","author_type":"Bot","body":"### Nullish coalescing skips valid anchor for zero estimate\n\n**Low Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\nWhen a user adds enough margin to push the estimated liquidation price below zero, `estimateLiquidationPrice` clamps it to `0` via `Math.max(0, estimated)`. Because `??` only coalesces on `null`/`undefined`, `estimatedLiquidationPrice ?? anchorLiquidationPrice` evaluates to `0` (not the valid anchor), and `formatPerpsLiquidationPrice(0)` returns `'--'`. The valid anchor liquidation price is lost. Meanwhile, the distance display correctly falls back to the anchor distance via an explicit `isPerpsLiquidationPriceValid` check — creating an inconsistency where distance shows a valid percentage but price shows `'--'`.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: c1cb7c8f-f824-4082-b19c-b1ccf2bfa76d --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/components/app/perps/edit-margin/edit-margin-modal-content.tsx#L186-L189\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..kLNCFK_mk7ihkiT2K-uWCQ6dvENHfCXkZeWU6plriR8uASED8bMaEBB_PAq6c_H_NgEbvbkfN0PT4bvHOUm2Mp-EYXVKS8l9QLGqG0t50NoSTww5ADXt_WMOBmr0_-I-rCoUMiNTd9gqHeglzsIk6WUSc--roioLUm5nOCswbFlaDqHyfTo70s19kn3LGhkN30NqGrEcEyWZL9JJhW18RrZoZXr28QwoznMiAyv95G9T-jrYxaH8kdA7LwwtOj2I0BfScY0fjHnegqdkX3whKHoAfcpbzItLdsA5Dbb3D25X-ewxoKkGXxWIZodredaElLznWklYnN90FBz9eAiu5w\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003